<item><title>Female artisanal miners report systemic sexual violence in Kono district</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/female-artisanal-miners-report-systemic-sexual-violence-in-556e1d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/female-artisanal-miners-report-systemic-sexual-violence-in-556e1d/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>Women working in abandoned diamond and gold pits in Jaiama Nimikor describe a pattern of rape and harassment with little recourse from local authorities.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 08:45:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/female-artisanal-miners-report-systemic-sexual-violence-in-556e1d/share.jpg" length="44772" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/female-artisanal-miners-report-systemic-sexual-violence-in-556e1d/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
